This product includes text from OpenAI Codex (https://github.com/openai/codex),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

- src/prompts.ts contains a summary prefix copied from:
  codex-rs/prompts/templates/compact/summary_prefix.md
- src/prompts.ts contains handoff instructions adapted from:
  codex-rs/prompts/templates/compact/prompt.md
- catalog/*.json contains model metadata and prompts copied or adapted from:
  codex-rs/models-manager/models.json
  Each catalog entry records its source tag, commit, and changes.
- benchmarks/compaction/prompts/ contains frozen or adapted compact prompts,
  the summary prefix, and model instructions from OpenAI Codex, together with
  user-supplied experiment prompts. File hashes and source notes are recorded
  in benchmarks/compaction/prompts/manifest.json.
- benchmarks/compaction/retention.py adapts the text-only user-message retention
  and middle-truncation logic from codex-rs/core/src/compact_remote_v2.rs and
  codex-rs/utils/string/src/truncate.rs at rust-v0.162.1.

benchmarks/compaction/fixture.py adapts the product-defaults fixture generator
from algal/pi-openai-server-compaction, Copyright (c) 2026 Alexis Gallagher,
